        "caption": null,
        "alt": "English Club"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "ELE_Net is starting an English club for AKU students to provide an opportunity to practise using English in a relaxed and friendly setting. This is part of a plan to develop a culture of using English for everyday communication and in so doing improve students' confidence and fluency when using English."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Students will lead the club activities.  An ELE_Net mentor will be present in all the club meetings to guide the students. ELE_Net hopes students will be able to hold an annual show by club members."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The English language Club will start soon! If you are interested in joining, sign up by emailing us at ele.net@aku.edu."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
